{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5AotmRGsw83Pqdz3hk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*Click.*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place. A deep, resonant vibration hums through the frame.\n\nI am closed.\n\nI am the boundary between where you are and where you wish to be. My grain runs deep — old oak, iron-banded, cool to the touch. The keyhole watches you like a single dark eye.\n\nYou feel the draft curling beneath me, carrying the scent of what lies beyond: stone, rain, something older.\n\nMy handle does not turn from this side.\n\nWhat do you do?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":120,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}